nodes.prompt:
Brand: {{brand.brand_name}} — {{brand.brand_summary}}
Hook: {{inputs.hook}}
Steps: {{inputs.steps}}
CTA: {{inputs.cta}}

Write copy for one 15-second screen walkthrough. `spoken_line` is optional narration, at most 28 words. `overlays` has exactly 3 entries with `text`, `start`, `end`, and `position`; first is a hook at the top from 0 to 5 seconds, next two name the action or outcome at the bottom. `position` is top, center, or bottom.
